  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s1",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient was admitted to the ___ for b/l CIA stenting.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12665381-DS-5:chars=1854-1911",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s2",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "She",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12665381-DS-5:chars=1912-1915",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s3",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "She underwent stenting of her bilateral iliac arteries, which \nrequired an ___\nsheath in the left common femoral artery.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12665381-DS-5:chars=1918-2038",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s4",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Upon completion of \nher iliac artery stenting the ___ sheath was pulled and \ndirect pressure was held over the arteriotomy.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12665381-DS-5:chars=2040-2163",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s5",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "However, the \nartery continued to bleed and there was a large groin\nhematoma.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12665381-DS-5:chars=2165-2242",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s6",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "As the sheath in her right groin  was still \npresent,an Omni Flush catheter was placed in her aorta and an \narteriogram of the left common femoral artery was performed, \nwhich showed continued bleeding through the arteriotomy as well \nas what looked like an occlusion of the common femoral artery.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12665381-DS-5:chars=2244-2541",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s7",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Examination of her foot revealed that it was cool and pulseless.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12665381-DS-5:chars=2542-2606",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s8",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Given this, we elected to go from the endovascular suite to the \noperating room for open repair of\nthe common femoral artery.She then underwent Left common femoral \nendarterectomy with Dacronpatch angioplasty and evacuation of \nleft groin hematoma.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12665381-DS-5:chars=2609-2857",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s9",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Please refer to op report for details.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12665381-DS-5:chars=2858-2896",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s10",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient was extubated later and she reported some numbness \nand decreased movement of her left foot.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12665381-DS-5:chars=2897-3001",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s11",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "However, her sensation \nand movement improved during her hospital cause.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12665381-DS-5:chars=3002-3074",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s12",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "On POD1,she was also started on a heparin drip.Her diet was \nadvanced to a regular diet.She was also started on her home \nmeds.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12665381-DS-5:chars=3075-3202",
   "needs": []
  },
